    "interpretation": "EXIOBASE measures only the allocative channel (which sectors governments buy from). EU ETS installation data confirms within-sector CV=2.54, meaning the unmeasured technical channel (which firms within sectors are selected) could add 0.9%-5.0% to the total premium. Our EXIOBASE-based estimates are conservative lower bounds on the true competition-carbon relationship."
